                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Where does ITD win vs other skincare agencies?</h3>
                                        <p>Sub-vertical fluency (ayurveda + clean + clinical + K-beauty + men's + colour + halal + GCC + India Tier 1+2). Heritage-storytelling + PR + Vogue-tier ambition. Full-stack bundled at Growth-tier price. Founder-founder + senior-strategist access. Transparent + no markup + 6-month MSA + 100% client IP + investor-grade reporting.</p>
                                        <h3>Where do alternatives win?</h3>
                                        <p>Pure-play technology (WebEngage / MoEngage) = deeper platform capabilities. WhatsApp specialists = deeper WhatsApp Cloud API. Big agency-of-record = enterprise scale. Creative-only boutiques = deeper standalone brand identity. International agencies = US + UK + Europe fluency.</p>
                                        <h3>When should we choose ITD?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 15L-1.5 Cr / year Starter, Rs 1.5-20 Cr Growth, Rs 20 Cr+ Enterprise + India + GCC dual-market ambition + sub-vertical fluency needed + full-stack bundled preferred + compliance + attribution + transparency priorities + founder-founder access baseline.</p>
                                        <h3>When should we NOT choose ITD?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 100+ Cr category-leader with enterprise agency-of-record need + US + UK + Europe international-first + very early Rs 5L/mo validation stage + pure standalone brand identity rebrand + enterprise media buying scale for Rs 20 Cr+/year ad spend.</p>
                                        <h3>Is ITD too small for our brand?</h3>
                                        <p>ITD manages Rs 8Cr+ annual ad spend across 100+ D2C brands + 20+ published skincare playbooks + 4+ case studies + 11 GCC city pages. Growth-tier scale. Right for Rs 15L-Rs 100+ Cr revenue brands. Above Rs 100+ Cr, consider big agency-of-record complement.</p>
                                        <h3>Is ITD suitable for international-first brands?</h3>
                                        <p>Best for India + GCC dual-market OR GCC-first OR India-first with GCC option. Not primary choice for USA + UK + Europe international-first brands. International agencies have deeper local market fluency there.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD compare to Wpromote or Metric Theory?</h3>
                                        <p>ITD stronger for India + GCC skincare. Wpromote / Metric Theory / Tinuiti stronger for USA + UK international-first brands. For dual-market India + USA, hybrid model (ITD India + GCC + international agency USA / UK) often works.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD structure engagement vs alternatives?</h3>
                                        <p>ITD standard: 6-month MSA + cancellation after month 3 + transparent ad spend pass-through + 100% client IP + investor-grade reporting + founder + senior access baseline. See <a href="/resources/skincare_d2c_agency_contract_essentials.php">contract essentials piece</a>.</p>
